      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a strong start. I like the phrasing \"myopic worldview.\" To push the essay further, I want to make sure the reader understands that the other side's arguments aren't just different, but fundamentally irrational. Can you help me write a section that explains why the conservative characters' reliance on traditionalism is actually just a mask for fear and an inability to process modern reality?",
